    "created_at": "2017-02-03T06:41:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-03T06:41:21Z",
    "body": "What would it actually do? I don't think you can assume that every combination will work; e.g., `git+ftp` doesn't work AFAIK. Each combination seems like it will require documentation of its own (e.g., how Git uses HTTP, how git uses SSH).",
